    ⚠️ <strong>WEEKEND OTC IS A SYNTHETIC MARKET.</strong> Prices are generated by broker algorithms — NOT real supply/demand.<br>
    Key differences vs weekdays: <strong>Lower range per candle · More fake spikes · Trap moves before real direction · Choppy reversals · No news catalysts</strong><br>
